{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01903","headline":"杂曲歌辞 秋夜长 · 王勃","name":"杂曲歌辞 秋夜长","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋夜长，殊未央。\n月明白露澄清光，层城绮阁遥相望。\n遥相望，川无梁。\n北风受节鴈南翔，崇兰委质时菊芳。\n鸣环曳履出长廊，爲君秋夜捣衣裳。\n纤罗对凤皇，丹绮双鸳鸯。\n调砧乱杵思自伤，思自伤，征夫万里戍他乡。\n鹤关音信断，龙门道路长。\n所在天一方，寒衣徒自香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}